fastlowess provides the upstream CMake target:

    find_package(fastlowess CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE fastlowess::fastlowess)

This port installs a checksum-pinned upstream CPU DLL. Rust and Cargo are not
required. Debug and Release consumers use the same Release DLL and release CRT.
Only x64 Windows with the dynamic MSVC runtime is supported.